SUMMARY:What Changed Your Mind?
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nWhat belief\, assumption\, or o
 pinion have you genuinely changed your mind about—and what changed it?\n
 \nMaybe it was religion\, politics\, science\, morality\, relationships\, 
 gender\, economics\, or something completely unexpected.\nEach person will
  have a few minutes to tell the story of **one thing they once believed an
 d no longer do**\, and what evidence\, experience\, argument\, or person c
 aused the shift.\n\nWe’ll hear everyone first\, without debate or interr
 uption\, then open the conversation.\n\nThis is not about proving who is r
 ight. It’s about something central to freethought: **being willing to re
 consider what we think we know.**\n\nFood and drinks available for individ
 ual purchase. Here's the menu: https://551west.com/menu/food/\n\n**Attenda
 nce is limited to 8\, including the organizer.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-freethought-society/events/
 316401573/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260903T142014Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260903T142014Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
